    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP. Use it in the opposing player's Movement phase at the moment an enemy unit other than a MONSTER or VEHICLE is picked to Fall Back. Pick a HERETIC ASTARTES DAEMON VEHICLE or VASHTORR THE ARKIFANE unit of yours that the enemy unit is engaged with (within Engagement Range). For the rest of the phase, any non-MONSTER, non-VEHICLE enemy unit that Falls Back while within your unit's Engagement Range must have each of its models take a Desperate Escape test, each test taking -1 if the fleeing unit is Battle-shocked.",
